    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <heading>Short title</heading>
        <content>
          <p><b>1</b><b>.</b>	This Act may be cited as the <i>Vocational Education and Training Funding Amendment Act 1995</i>.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <content>
          <p><b>2.</b>	This Act commences on the day on which it receives the Royal Assent.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
